#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:5
#: 019d66bff2a34914a6106b917bc7f7a6 2279eb2d1a654d679b9eb44be52c5c2e
#: 2709c80a2c014556b8447a64574f6eb3 340fa647fbb54f6f811d11e462c6e17b
#: 4793839a4a264250a08493898085c229 82f53fe10af74ab586287eea04c9d646
#: b280033efbe94f29ac052d0e91253a5a ed0055e7018f460f91d3dc6665bf2f78
msgid "PWM, OneShot and OneShot125 ESCs"
msgstr "PWM、OneShot和OneShot125 ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:7
#: 07caf1d10f1c4ed580a573661b61737a 23fdfefad96d45dda3e650d116a1ec2c
#: 336b37afdf824d6cbe8f02a7e8d69a04 510d48cef63a4f6d861b20af4ea2ee86
#: 78f743cdbefa48ec8d0d5996c2c7357d 8b2d1320cdd548aca78aabe8897c08cb
#: 9b2f64e94eed4bf9a562c7025f17f5fb ffb73929b9b24eb3a93b482fe57cd821
msgid ""
"Most ArduPilot vehicles use brushless motors controlled by brushless motor "
"ESCs. The most common protocols used by these ESCs are PWM, OneShot, "
"OneShot125, and :ref:`DShot <common-dshot-escs>`. This page describes the "
"first three (PWM, OneShot and OneShot125)."
msgstr ""
"大多数ArduPilot飞行器使用无刷电机，由无刷电机ESC控制。这些ESC最常用的协议是PWM、OneShot、OneShot125和 "
":ref:`DShot <common-dshot-escs>`。本页介绍前三种（PWM、OneShot和OneShot125）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:9
#: 0997756657ee4675acc089967929aa3a 0e06dcfc5a6446ddb16b6d5ff69f63f9
#: 38d46495e6344c5dbbb1755dc4dd85f7 3a9d9cf86a084b7eae7a9f4e1dc66ace
#: 7a87de8e530e47cd9e4229e089198621 b0358b2e8e91442c92711d9bce18fe8b
#: fc52dade6f7a4934b1e5c3ffd787d162 fdede99cc0c44aee883c2dfdb5c7013f
msgid ""
"Be sure your ESC can support the configuration you select for it. Damage can"
" occur otherwise. This includes frame rates discussed below. Also be careful"
" when switching between protocols without rebooting or re-calibrating ESCs "
"as this can lead to uncommanded motor output."
msgstr "请确保您的ESC支持所选配置，否则可能造成损坏。这包括下文讨论的帧率。在不重启或重新校准ESC的情况下切换协议，可能导致电机意外输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:12
#: 08c3870367e64185ae5573ad1dc43694 1ba4795072134a478509fc9cb4b7a655
#: 491a69bc3eed440aae0336dcf7fdad8a 7cf04602267d4328867404c76bc8222c
#: 97942912b90c4d9eb1fe6d73c21bcbaf b552fc2beec2497798dbae8a3b1494c7
#: e32947a56f0747f8be0462b7ea7dab29 e66de40c034b4ca78a03da3e3133c89e
msgid "PWM"
msgstr "PWM"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:13
#: 099c2a170b404f6b8077d11f447890d5 148d5ab32a354d45b971bd0fb2b434d9
#: 2deaaee82f04411bac52fe9fe2f0540d 4ed87af6bc814964a213921d34540204
#: 6fef1f0fe86444e3b22dacd4599d6a54 c13bea75c75b42c89618eea3a987ba7d
#: d4e3eebe98214fb0b558b0eaeac35dc4 dd272ca732cb45919d92363bb053c6f1
msgid ""
"These are the most common ESCs for non-copter applications and were "
"historically the first brushless ESCs."
msgstr "这是非多旋翼应用中最常见的ESC类型，也是历史上最早出现的无刷ESC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:17
#: 06391a749598414d949a596e7235d108 065c0edff5d04cd7b8dceabc45d338ed
#: 6beb3cd98fab471cbe53247decc651b4 935cedc1d9714781b758f3910299ed1f
#: acb8eb0f00fc4bf8aaa4a2821cdb58e9 b2e0434787ba46f5be51fc9b1d88c2ac
#: ddaa034514844aa38495f870e5e46e55 faa49b73ca23438bb907bb46952959cf
msgid ""
"PWM ESCs use a periodic input pulse of width typically between 1000uS and "
"2000uS for zero to full power, respectively."
msgstr "PWM ESC使用脉冲宽度为1000uS到2000uS的周期输入脉冲，分别对应零功率和全功率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:20
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:21
#: 5c7db15595124579acb0a8b88e0cba82 71a68722120148ac8d46fead09fb9dd4
#: cef8b2b4878749b6912487122746463e d39b852602fe42e79325dcde316637a7
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE <MOT_PWM_TYPE>` to 0/Normal (the default) and reboot "
"the autopilot"
msgstr "将 :ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE <MOT_PWM_TYPE>` 设置为0/Normal（默认值），然后重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:21
#: 31fb7878b6244ce6a12a5b2b875751b1 6c9fa94ebad64a4fa9950d6b9fc82ce8
msgid ""
":ref:`MOT_PWM_MIN <MOT_PWM_MIN>` and :ref:`MOT_PWM_MAX <MOT_PWM_MAX>` "
"specify the PWM range sent to motors (e.g. where :ref:`SERVOx_FUNCTION "
"<SERVO1_FUNCTION>` = \"Motor1\", \"Motor2\", etc).  See :ref:`ESC "
"Calibration <esc-calibration>` for info on aligning the autopilot's output "
"range with the ESC's input range."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MOT_PWM_MIN <MOT_PWM_MIN>` 和 :ref:`MOT_PWM_MAX <MOT_PWM_MAX>` "
"指定发送至电机的PWM范围（即 :ref:`SERVOx_FUNCTION <SERVO1_FUNCTION>` = 「Motor1」、「Motor2」"
" 等的输出）。有关如何使飞控输出范围与ESC输入范围对齐的信息，请参阅 :ref:`ESC校准 <esc-calibration>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:23
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:26
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:29
#: 0c4631b5d86f43ff984360fc53aa8788 2c8d8414e1794056a3ea8a11c4a45f68
#: 5d31eba6bd0c49ca96868f8782609bc7 d6efc58dad3248df8dd9665eebbd6f30
#: db9d108e4033406c85c4a27f0abc095c e702939ef3254e9bada471bd48201f60
#: f6b9a8c9fb51444c917842e9a1369109 fb2a2e7cca7b47d28ac9d3484e298e69
msgid ""
"The frame rate of these pulses is usually between 50Hz to 490Hz. The faster "
"frame rates allow quicker control reactions to be sent to the motor, if the "
"ESC has capability for those frame rates."
msgstr "这些脉冲的帧率通常在50Hz到490Hz之间。若ESC支持更高帧率，则更快的帧率可向电机发送更快速的控制响应。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:29
#: 40733b0b317148c1b5656beda0466224 d2de0c04384c413294f2d84bac4d2891
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`RC_SPEED <RC_SPEED>` to change the frame rate (default is 490Hz)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RC_SPEED <RC_SPEED>` 以更改帧率（默认为490Hz）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:29
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:34
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:38
#: 52c56071caa84972a5711d881e3c6d43 5b9ead7917164573b4697062378f5790
#: 61d1f1ce5b7048bbb314e1701d886f51 73e1fbc9195246e68af17a934014c731
#: 9087a3a94fff40b6946b3512022989ac 9527e6f3029140de8e69284dedaae1af
#: d657dd516d7d43bebfbdf1dfe91df246 fe7179288404480ba44324e1a9a376e2
msgid ""
"be sure of the capabilities of your ESC before selecting a higher frame rate"
" to avoid damage to the ESC."
msgstr "请在选择更高帧率前确认您的ESC支持该帧率，以免损坏ESC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:32
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:37
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:41
#: 04e6e8b4cb8b4f2f95be419e5225c2a0 141f7545115e4f22a46d08377c562867
#: 5d9c615ef2304ae9a135b02b66332796 6e2e5cceded34d1ca43e6340ef4ea83f
#: 7230d3bb1ff74ce39ff19184b7cef5bb 80cb7cce0e7b409d89089bd963ec1566
#: b11c2471bf5344a69e73092feecf43f2 ebde36f0237844e2ac0698f1de454f88
msgid "OneShot"
msgstr "OneShot"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:34
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:39
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:43
#: 145b0f83d0be47829052fb9b7028f51f 1c1a36f4560140b2a7bde6a84a016791
#: 2c165939e81543c2aaa9ac5af509763c 403e56a18c3e426a967e9a85c5a5d12f
#: 67f41f4b0c294470954800ddd6c25876 992ec5003aef4b5e8607307771dbb0cb
#: b4ca9dbd2506454fabc0663d2e7c36aa c7f4e1c32d524aa9917d72d63cf3fe67
msgid ""
"OneShot (not to be confused with \"OneShot125\") is an older protocol that "
"uses the same pulse widths as Normal PWM but has a fixed frame rate equal to"
" the autopilot main loop rate.  There is little advantage for using this "
"protocol over regular PWM."
msgstr ""
"OneShot（不要与 「OneShot125」 "
"混淆）是一种较旧的协议，使用与普通PWM相同的脉冲宽度，但帧率固定等于飞控主循环频率。相比普通PWM，使用此协议的优势很小。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:42
#: 0f8830a7693740fbb0024b4f6bfb6f4f 40474af614ef42d19e19675105692259
#: 7332ec67e78c44a1a9190b841c434b74 d72a75152ea64699b756fd5549285830
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE <MOT_PWM_TYPE>` to 1 (OneShot) and reboot the "
"autopilot"
msgstr "将 :ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE <MOT_PWM_TYPE>` 设置为1（OneShot），然后重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:40
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:47
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:53
#: 097f6e45b45343f39a64ede4403934af 1c5c2bfadaec4ebd88908b7298cd6dc7
#: 1cb9f65d017244fbbbe05f8243765205 2b79c80cb8e54f7b81fdbf327c7f8e91
#: 63654306c145488280661c977edc95b5 b9380794a89648388b71cb4cd2129c5b
#: f0e0371dcdc94c7ba94d41f941597285 fc721531df554becb1300c93b03fe88d
msgid "OneShot 125"
msgstr "OneShot 125"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:42
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:49
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:55
#: 00af37488cb541bb8cf8f9df420d425c 18fad18f1bed4884bdad4ae954bbc989
#: 30e83fc392e74819929bb1e9b9777228 a073435e3b224d91846eb8896107ccc8
#: cc6a3c06d4b44134bf2c66738b6ef4ad d358419be2be4e7ca18e4989f61684d1
#: d8b91118a5864308b5bcc338bda4e395 ff5f1ffbebe244bf9482fe8a0f0c606d
msgid ""
"The OneShot125 (sometimes confusingly shortened to just OneShot) protocol is"
" similar to regular PWM except that the pulse widths are divided by a factor"
" of 8 which allows faster communication from the autopilot to the ESC.  "
"Individual pulses are sent more quickly and the overall frame rate can be "
"increased up to 490Hz."
msgstr ""
"OneShot125（有时被混淆地简称为OneShot）协议与普通PWM类似，但脉冲宽度缩小为原来的八分之一，从而实现飞控到ESC的更快通信。单个脉冲发送更快，整体帧率可提高至490Hz。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:52
#: 2f758ce454aa42e6ae9dcdf5fc2892cc 6b99cf710bcf455e8792bc58ae8a092f
#: 714fa86951be4f778f6706a717a2c124 74b0893321e447ecbf2407cbb789db28
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE <MOT_PWM_TYPE>` to 2 (OneShot125) and reboot the "
"autopilot"
msgstr "将 :ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE <MOT_PWM_TYPE>` 设置为2（OneShot125），然后重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:47
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:56
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:63
#: 0e7e2f5d8c7849dabac94b675b712094 1a7da8d2a2cc40d089e6b636e8df55cd
#: 1e6f57957b3b4452bbb7bccc0fd1f4e7 5404843903fd4387894ed60f1f52dfc5
#: 60084dfcd82b4a729980fa31c1fe9206 aa0ec0ef973444febe805d6f14c02793
#: b9ff7e2ee0e747e78fd9cf3a9c571157 c97b3551540d49849080479f1d793f32
msgid ""
"If using an autopilot with an IOMCU (e.g. Pixhawk, CubeOrange) the ESCs "
"should be connected to the AUX outputs and the corresponding "
":ref:`SERVOx_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` values should be set to \"Motor1\","
" etc.  This can be most easily done using Mission Planner's \"Servo Output\""
" page"
msgstr ""
"若使用带IOMCU的飞控（如Pixhawk、CubeOrange），ESC应连接至AUX输出，并将相应的 :ref:`SERVOx_FUNCTION "
"<SERVO9_FUNCTION>` 值设置为 「Motor1」 等。可在Mission Planner的「舵机输出」页面轻松完成此操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:51
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:60
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:67
#: 19dc4796b66349998952528feebad21b 439d71311ee043ec9c528eae589eaf7f
#: 71279aa54dc946a6b027c86bb8da8442 89d27092361c4285b76eb6160d5e11fb
#: bf3d0be94a434901895ba4377b23c548 c7934b6ca6df4a13bcebca7a2fab42b1
#: d49a5ab79416498aad26529e803159df d933f56d55f6465a9468ee8f3adebba7
msgid ""
"Reboot the autopilot and check the \"RC banner\" to confirm the output "
"channels are setup as expected (this banner appears whenever parameters are "
"downloaded)"
msgstr "重启飞控并检查「RC banner」以确认输出通道配置符合预期（此banner在下载参数时出现）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:58
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:67
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:74
#: 06f02c72f2dd4e53bd09934e02e4324b 6f3371e008794d50954c70b6f13e565d
#: 7fa1332a37b24ad09411a2ce6d471e0e 8ac261da628d43edad6b3827cfd98b17
#: befeb29794214d73aabe2ede13662937 c0569ec5e8dc4f51be9fbf298ffa21c0
#: f72f1a1889c04a098173b50d7abc1fd2 fbde7a5906a54970843a9480162ebb0f
msgid "Mixing ESC Protocols"
msgstr "混用ESC协议"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:60
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:69
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:76
#: 1c37d9aa87234c3c8f1309efea19dc16 26cf77ba0c8c4794b13f39e1b0db6709
#: 78baa13e3e9542a699991fb9b46ec6a0 7fc86497f1114de1aed5169159135c0d
#: 8af0d102a0ca4db99d8bd9bd2cdbd0ec 8dcc9743451b4b5e84dff40b6774fdfd
#: 9147041991c14b37b6d41389d94e509d e0e80e3b0c244fb5bb6698c15d2b5914
msgid ""
"While all the servo/motor outputs of an ArduPilot autopilot are capable of "
"Normal PWM operation at 50Hz frame rates, not all are capable of other ESC "
"protocols. And, usually, these configurations must apply to pre-designated "
"groups of outputs, even if they are not all driving an ESC. So the following"
" cautions apply:"
msgstr ""
"虽然ArduPilot飞控的所有舵机/电机输出均能以50Hz帧率进行普通PWM操作，但并非所有输出都支持其他ESC协议。通常，这些配置必须应用于预先指定的输出组，即使该组中并非所有输出都连接了ESC。因此需注意以下事项："

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:62
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:71
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:78
#: 215cb4fd5aae416e806cd5e12332d31d 3cedc030975c4827969ca01f6da3c5ee
#: 421b9eb0410c45b5b469c90bfa792180 7808ec4491be4adca593341be9fc24e5
#: 8c8727a67eed4e37a8ebe4cdd5e54aa2 9c73b8b97c914b8eb93d864051c0461d
#: b8b9c43668074eafb9ef4a3458c2699e ee3bd98bedf04a4c9280608ca4c49bd3
msgid ""
"The 8 \"MAIN\" outputs of autopilots using an IOMCU (like PixHawk and Cube),"
" cannot be used for  protocols other than Normal PWM and OneShot. On these "
"autopilots, only the additional \"AUX\" outputs can properly support "
"OneShot125. If you attempt to set a \"MAIN\" output to OneShot125, then "
"normal PWM output will occur, even though it has been set to a OneShot125 "
"protocol."
msgstr ""
"使用IOMCU的飞控（如PixHawk和Cube）的8个「MAIN」输出，除普通PWM和OneShot外，不能用于其他协议。在这些飞控上，只有额外的「AUX」输出才能正常支持OneShot125。若尝试将「MAIN」输出设置为OneShot125，实际上仍会输出普通PWM，即使已设置为OneShot125协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:64
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:73
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:80
#: 2a659b256a9b4cabaadab648056eaba3 37ed597a5bc341b78b9f457c94f8f70e
#: 3a00be0a8dbd43dd96b117d60b1658e1 3cbf7835e3c540f28fb4351d922c845e
#: 4842b83af4d3475b93716e6cf571583e 687dd5d7331642059b3660901c0b4f28
#: 886ade900cb9443c9d02731994e3b320 a9172653b7e545da8680c1f4427c4978
msgid ""
"For :ref:`Pixracer <common-pixracer-overview>` and :ref:`other boards "
"<common-autopilots>` without a separate IOMCU coprocessor, all servo/motor "
"outputs can be used."
msgstr ""
"对于 :ref:`Pixracer <common-pixracer-overview>` 和其他没有独立 IOMCU 协处理器的 :ref:`飞控 "
"<common-autopilots>`，所有舵机/电机输出均可使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:66
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:75
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:82
#: 1048e5f28631434c9505b8f565e90463 1dfc4f22ca8746d6b79920679eca5381
#: 254952cfd3e74ed9b561133838ed1c87 5079a31f0f6a4dbd974b810cae3c8414
#: 9cc68f5858cb4e3c81d7b02b40b92823 b0c537dd3260410a9849ca3a0e78b7db
#: be45faa0f3d344d6bf0073e52084294d dc6999e72d75443c93eef36e62006e79
msgid ""
"Groups of outputs sharing a common timer, MUST have the same advanced "
"configuration. Usually, these are specified in the autopilot's hardware "
"description linked from the :ref:`common-autopilots` page. For example, if "
"an output is configured for OneShot125 in a group, then you cannot use "
"another output in that group for Normal PWM ESC **or** normal PWM servo "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"共享同一定时器的输出组，必须使用相同的高级配置。通常在 :ref:`common-autopilots` "
"页面链接的飞控硬件说明中有所指定。例如，若某组中某输出配置为OneShot125，则该组中的其他输出不能用于普通PWM ESC **或** "
"普通PWM舵机操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:68
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:77
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:84
#: 2492ea28dfc647f6805fc62caaf533d2 6329b75d3ca14ac2aeadeec1d68cd34a
#: b9879b6b22684f9f91158b027bb02b7c c173c63d0fef4979ad91afd562421833
msgid ""
"Everytime the autopilot initializes, it sends the \"RC Banner\" to the "
"ground control station, showing which outputs are PWM, OneShot, OneShot125 "
"or DShot. The remaining higher numbered outputs are assigned as GPIOs."
msgstr ""
"每次飞控初始化时，都会向地面站发送「RC "
"Banner」，显示哪些输出为PWM、OneShot、OneShot125或DShot。编号较高的剩余输出分配为GPIO。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:22
#: a9c5d1a0a78c4b169da5627bba7dabce c6225a0c19d74ab1827262ce6e3c90e7
msgid ""
"Forward motors will use normal PWM unless OneShot (see below) or :ref:`DShot"
" <common-dshot-escs>` has been enabled.  The PWM range for each channel is "
"specified by the corresponding :ref:`SERVOx_MIN <SERVO3_MIN>` and "
":ref:`SERVOx_MAX <SERVO3_MAX>` parameters."
msgstr ""
"前向电机将使用普通 PWM，除非启用了 OneShot（见下文）或 :ref:`DShot <common-dshot-escs>`。每个通道的 PWM"
" 范围由相应的 :ref:`SERVOx_MIN <SERVO3_MIN>` 和 :ref:`SERVOx_MAX <SERVO3_MAX>` "
"参数指定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:23
#: 1e7e91d758d24911b7b2a062e9ade16b 3411370d1b01427ea41de8a61d2dcc07
msgid ""
"VTOL motors will use normal PWM when :ref:`Q_M_PWM_TYPE <Q_M_PWM_TYPE>` is "
"0/Normal (the default).  The PWM range is specified by the :ref:`Q_M_PWM_MIN"
" <Q_M_PWM_MIN>` and :ref:`Q_M_PWM_MAX <Q_M_PWM_MAX>` parameters"
msgstr ""
"当 :ref:`Q_M_PWM_TYPE <Q_M_PWM_TYPE>` 为 0/普通（默认）时，VTOL 电机将使用普通 PWM。PWM 范围由 "
":ref:`Q_M_PWM_MIN <Q_M_PWM_MIN>` 和 :ref:`Q_M_PWM_MAX <Q_M_PWM_MAX>` 参数指定"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:24
#: 618d18d5c9814463b93efd2e0d95887d afed2aeba1194354943993fc444233fd
msgid ""
"See :ref:`ESC Calibration <common-esc-calibration>` for info on aligning the"
" autopilot's output range with the ESC's input range."
msgstr ""
"请参阅 :ref:`ESC 校准 <common-esc-calibration>` 了解如何将飞控输出范围与 ESC 输入范围对齐的信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:26
#: 1e6d90d950f64cdcbcbd3aeb36836a6b 61e62aaa2b8c4697b6d6102c2c64f14b
msgid "The autopilot should be re-booted after changing the protocol type."
msgstr "更改协议类型后应重新启动飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:34
#: 347e9932c1954cde8745b3381c47a928 55f4c4431f2e40a1a43a1da69b8f4353
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERVO_RATE <SERVO_RATE>` to change the frame rate for forward "
"motors (default is 50hz)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`SERVO_RATE <SERVO_RATE>` 以更改前向电机的输出帧率（默认 50Hz）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:35
#: 20bc56a9091f4d59867754ac79696951 814061fbede0440cae30a7c0ea158d26
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`Q_RC_SPEED <Q_RC_SPEED>` to change the frame rate for the VTOL "
"esc/motors (default is 490Hz)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`Q_RC_SPEED <Q_RC_SPEED>` 以更改 VTOL ESC/电机的输出帧率（默认 490Hz）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:47
#: 4c070524959e4d83903076604c8347e2 a389263769d94ba9b5907e7bbc466e76
msgid ""
"Oneshot (not Oneshot125) loop synchronization can be added to any motor "
"running an normal PWM ESC or servo using the :ref:`ONESHOT_MASK "
"<ONESHOT_MASK>` bitmask. It will trigger pulses at the :ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE"
" <SCHED_LOOP_RATE>`, but no lower than at 250Hz. Be sure the ESCs can handle"
" this rate."
msgstr ""
"OneShot（非 OneShot125）循环同步可以使用 :ref:`ONESHOT_MASK <ONESHOT_MASK>` "
"位掩码添加到任何运行普通 PWM ESC 或舵机的电机上。它将在 :ref:`SCHED_LOOP_RATE <SCHED_LOOP_RATE>` "
"下触发脉冲，但不低于 250Hz。确保 ESC 能处理此速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:49
#: 334d1d3c299f46a7bccd671704f277b4 8b09c4abce50411b9db88bd2988f68a5
msgid ""
"VTOL motors will use OneShot if :ref:`Q_M_PWM_TYPE <Q_M_PWM_TYPE>` is 1 "
"(OneShot)"
msgstr "如果 :ref:`Q_M_PWM_TYPE <Q_M_PWM_TYPE>` 为 1（OneShot），VTOL 电机将使用 OneShot"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:59
#: 1dc04c803cf44029980143fe33820dcb 897ba1452f944a439fcad3ef51aade53
msgid ""
"Forward motors will use normal PWM unless OneShot or DShot has been enabled "
"(see below)"
msgstr "除非启用了 OneShot 或 DShot，否则前向电机将使用普通 PWM（见下文）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:60
#: 46552aa9585b438ab047fbc0c9001247 f18d3aa204b34128bc1d324a5be1ae79
msgid ""
"VTOL motors will use OneShot125 if :ref:`Q_M_PWM_TYPE <Q_M_PWM_TYPE>` is 2 "
"(OneShot125)"
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`Q_M_PWM_TYPE <Q_M_PWM_TYPE>` 为 2（OneShot125），VTOL 电机将使用 OneShot125"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:22
#: a02f260c7536408b914d367153cf6b32 fa649a7972f5471d8747bb6a3a9ec079
msgid ""
"The PWM range for each channel is specified by the corresponding "
":ref:`SERVOx_MIN <SERVO3_MIN>` and :ref:`SERVOx_MAX <SERVO3_MAX>` "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"每个通道的 PWM 范围由对应的 :ref:`SERVOx_MIN <SERVO3_MIN>` 和 :ref:`SERVOx_MAX "
"<SERVO3_MAX>` 参数指定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:30
#: 56a880c19172445890c1c54eb7d45eb1 97d242959d434f2ab6bc94b972e23654
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERVO_RATE <SERVO_RATE>` to change the frame rate (default is "
"50Hz)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`SERVO_RATE <SERVO_RATE>` 以更改帧率（默认为 50Hz）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:68
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:77
#: ../../source/docs/common-brushless-escs.rst:84
#: 25cec406411942b1873b41fb42de7a99 2bae6bb8569241a3820c7960a1c4db8f
#: 8ad4d8b037a14bb880eab937237574e7 fdfb204faa084f05843b97ebfd64032a
msgid ""
"Every time the autopilot initializes, it sends the \"RC Banner\" to the "
"ground control station, showing which outputs are PWM, OneShot, OneShot125 "
"or DShot. The remaining higher numbered outputs are assigned as GPIOs."
msgstr ""
"飞控每次初始化时都会向地面站发送 \"RC Banner\"，显示哪些输出为 PWM、OneShot、OneShot125 或 "
"DShot。其余编号更高的输出被分配为 GPIO。"
